<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary credits.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary credits.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico has completed all four credit auctions whereby it sought to place 4.897 billion pesos in the secondary market.</p>
<p>CREDIT AUCTIONS  TERM	MAX    MIN    AVERAGE BIDS BIDDERS</p>
<p>1.232  bln pesos 8 days    31.72  31.40  31.54   9    3</p>
<p>1.232  bln pesos 7 days    31.92  31.45  31.54   8    4</p>
<p>1.233  bln pesos 6 days    31.51  31.45  31.48   5    5</p>
<p>1.200  bln pesos 2 days    31.03  30.94  30.95   2    2</p>
<p>NOTE - The maximum, minimum and average are percentages.</p>
<p>- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9500</p>
</text>
